<title>USA: Caspian names Smithson global bank analyst.</title>
<headline>Caspian names Smithson global bank analyst.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Securities said Tuesday it had hired Simon Smithson as a senior global bank analyst.</p>
<p>Smithson most recently was Kleinwort Benson's Asian regional banking analyst. He spent 13 years at Kleinwort Benson and had been head of the firm's Japanese research department.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
